<title>PORTUGAL: Gas de Portugal launches 10 bln esc bond.</title>
<headline>Gas de Portugal launches 10 bln esc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gas de Portugal-GDP is launching a</p>
<p>10 billion escudos bond indexed to six-month Lisbor plus 7.5</p>
<p>basis points, announced joint leaders Banco Cisf and Banco</p>
<p>Portugues de Investimento.</p>
<p>ISSUER: GDP-Gas de Portugal</p>
<p>TYPE: Bond, private and direct subscription</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 10 bln esc</p>
<p>TERM: 10 years</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE: 1,000 escudos per bond</p>
<p>SUBSCRIPTION DATE: Foreseen 25 June 1997</p>
<p>INTEREST RATE: six-month Lisbor plus 7.5 basis points</p>
<p>REIMBURSEMENT: At par, at end of term</p>
<p>LISTING: To be requested on Lisbon bourse</p>
<p>JOINT LEADERS: Banco Cisf and Banco Portugues de Investimento</p>
<p>PAYING AGENT: Banco Comercial Portugues</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
